Murx wrote:

> IX Corp. wrote:
>
> > II'm personally waiting for the single CPU '264, as it looks rather faster
> > than the 164, SMP don't stably work yet on anything as far as I know, my
> > code is granular, and I won't really need the heavy metal until then
