I had the exact same problem.  I fixed it by changing
    boot fd0:NONAME.gz root=/dev/fd0 load_ramdisk=1 prompt_ramdisk=1

to

    boot fd0:noname.gz root=/dev/fd0 load_ramdisk=1 prompt_ramdisk=1



In other words, I made noname.gz lowercase, and it worked fine.



