> > crossbar switch. The switch has two memory ports (256b @ 83Mhz) which
> > theoretically gives the board >5GB/s memory bandwidth. The switch btw
> > is impemented by the core logic chipset (21272)
>
> Which would explain why the chipset has its own heatsink. Yow.
