Alex,

I have one of those too.  Don't limit yourself to 1G! It will handle anything up
to 6.3G internally.  Also, if your new system is like mine it will ship with an
8MB PCI video board from Digital.  Digital's board has been working fine for me
so you can probably save your money.  Finally, WebAuction ships these with only
32MB of RAM.  Find a source for 72pin parity RAM and add as much as it will
hold.  (64MB*6=384MB)


