Matt Brown <mdbrown@gauss.ee.calpoly.edu> writes:
>I just installed RedHat 5.1 on a Miata and it cannot see the network.

Is it the onboard NIC?  If so get the patched Tulip driver from:

  ftp://ftp.ens-lyon.fr/pub/users/LIP/krisrose/Debian/Alpha/Miata/


and compile yourself a kernel with it as a module.  Create a file
/etc/conf.modules with these lines:

alias eth0 tulip        # Ethernet on M/B
options tulip options=11


"Works for me".

Rob.



