Hi,

128MB - you will need two 64MB 168-pin unbuffered ECC SDRAM 10ns, 100MHz.
Alpha can be quite picky about RAM, it is best to buy from a reliable Alpha
vendor, unless you can buy from some commodity company that guarantees
compatibility and are willing to take the time to fiddle, possibly.

EPROM can be problematic, it depends on how neutral it is... some EPROM RAM
works fine, others are problematic.

Hard Data Ltd. is a great source for Alpha stuff...

try http://www.harddata.com or send e-mail to sales@harddata.com

