Check your battery.  There's a lithium cell on the motherboard which keeps the
clock.  Replacing that battery is fairly cheap and may solve the problem.
Probably a CR-2032 but check the markings on the cell.  You can probably get a
replacement at Radio Shack or any other similar store.

Keith

